<section class="oem-section" id="oem-showcase">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header text-center">
      <span class="badge-pill">SIALKOT FACTORY CAPABILITY</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">CUSTOM OEM / ODM SURGICAL MANUFACTURING</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        From surgical prototype blueprints to ISO 13485 cleanroom mass production and fiber laser private labeling.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="oem-process-grid">
      <div class="oem-step-card">
        <div class="oem-step-num">01</div>
        <h3 class="oem-step-title">CAD / CAM Blueprint Engineering</h3>
        <p class="oem-step-desc">Our design engineers convert physical samples, surgeon sketches, or 3D STEP files into high-tolerance CNC machining toolpaths.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="oem-step-card">
        <div class="oem-step-num">02</div>
        <h3 class="oem-step-title">Precision Drop Forging & Heat Treat</h3>
        <p class="oem-step-desc">Forged in German DIN 1.4021 steel with computer-controlled vacuum tempering to achieve calibrated Rockwell 54-58 HRC.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="oem-step-card">
        <div class="oem-step-num">03</div>
        <h3 class="oem-step-title">ASTM F899 Chemical Passivation</h3>
        <p class="oem-step-desc">Immersion in nitric/citric passivation baths to form an impervious chromium oxide protective layer that resists repeated autoclave cycles.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="oem-step-card">
        <div class="oem-step-num">04</div>
        <h3 class="oem-step-title">Laser Marking & Sterile Packaging</h3>
        <p class="oem-step-desc">High-precision fiber laser marking for custom logos, CE badges, and UDI barcodes. Packaged in Tyvek sterile pouches or custom cases.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="oem-cta-box text-center">
      <h3 class="oem-cta-heading">Ready to Engineer Your Proprietary Surgical Pattern?</h3>
      <p class="oem-cta-text">Low minimum order quantities (MOQs) starting from 25 units for custom surgical prototypes.</p>
      <a href="/pages/wholesale-custom-orders" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">START CUSTOM OEM PROJECT</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

